//! DAEMONIORUM Game UI Module
//!
//! Qliphoth-based UI components for the plurality-aware psychological horror game.
//! Built with native Sigil following the Corporate Goth aesthetic extended
//! with game-specific elements.
//!
//! ## Component Categories
//!
//! - **Tokens**: Game-specific design tokens (colors, animations, spacing)
//! - **Alter Card**: Alter display with PAD emotional states and abilities
//! - **System Meters**: Stability and dissociation visualization
//! - **Reality Layer**: Reality perception indicators and transitions
//! - **Combat UI**: Turn-based combat interface
//! - **Inventory**: Item management panel
//! - **Quest Tracker**: Quest/objective tracking
//! - **Game HUD**: Main heads-up display integrating all systems
//!
//! ## Usage
//!
//! ```sigil
//! use daemoniorum::ui::prelude::*;
//!
//! #[component]
//! fn GameScreen() -> Element! {
//!     let system_state! = use_game_state();
//!
//!     html! {
//!         <GameHUD
//!             system_state={system_state·clone()}
//!             current_scene={scene}
//!             inventory={inventory}
//!             quests={quests}
//!         />
//!     }
//! }
//! ```

